sequenceDiagram
  participant App as odc_onboard_v2
  participant Dev as QMI_device
  participant DMS as DMS
  participant UIM as UIM
  participant NAS as NAS
  participant WDS as WDS
  participant Net as wwan_iface

  App->>Dev: open PROXY NET_RAW_IP
  App->>Dev: allocate DMS NAS WDS UIM WDA CIDs
  App->>DMS: get_set operating_mode ONLINE
  App->>DMS: collect identity IMEI model
  App->>UIM: get_card_status
  alt PIN needed
    App->>UIM: verify_pin PIN1
  end
  App->>NAS: register serving_system indications
  NAS-->>App: REGISTERED
  App->>Net: set raw_ip Y and link up
  App->>WDS: start_network APN auth ip_type
  App->>WDS: get_current_settings
  App->>Net: configure IP GW DNS MTU
  App-->>App: Connected QmiConnectionEvent WanReady
  Note over WDS: retain WDS CID while connected
  App->>WDS: stop_network on disconnect
  App->>Net: deconfigure and link down
